  "title": "Origin Bancorp, Inc. Announces Entry Into Birmingham, | Origin Bank",
  "summary": "Origin Bancorp, Inc. (NYSE: OBK) (“Origin,” “we,” “our” or the“Company”), the holding company for Origin Bank (the “Bank”), today announced its entry into Birmingham, further expanding its presence in Alabama. The Bank has also announced that long-time local banker Will Hawkins has been hired to serve as Market Leader in Birmingham.",
